---
/**
 * Branches of law split by public / private interest (CJD Bach, unit 1).
 *
 * Each branch card names the unit of this book where it is actually studied,
 * so unit 1 doubles as the map of the whole course. The dividing line carries
 * the criterion (is one of the parties the public power acting as such?)
 * rather than leaving the split as a list to memorise.
 */
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 820 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Ramas del Derecho: público y privado">
  <title>Las ramas del Derecho</title>
  <desc>
    Las disciplinas jurídicas divididas en Derecho público y Derecho privado. En el
    público: constitucional, administrativo, penal, tributario, procesal e internacional
    público. En el privado: civil, mercantil e internacional privado. El Derecho laboral
    aparece a caballo entre ambos. Cada rama indica la unidad del libro en la que se
    estudia.
  </desc>
  <defs>
    <style>
      .bg { fill: #FBF6EC; }
      .col-pub { fill: #E0DCF0; stroke: #4A3B8F; stroke-width: 2; }
      .col-priv { fill: #DBEDED; stroke: #1F6E6E; stroke-width: 2; }
      .col-mix { fill: #F5E5BC; stroke: #A87A2A; stroke-width: 2; }
      .head-pub { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; fill: #382C6B; text-anchor: middle; }
      .head-priv { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; fill: #164F4F; text-anchor: middle; }
      .crit { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: #5C4A3D; text-anchor: middle; }
      .branch { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; fill: #2A1F18; }
      .where { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.6px; fill: #5C4A3D; }
      .divider { stroke: #C44E2C; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
      .divider-label { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; fill: #C44E2C; text-anchor: middle; }
      .mix-note { font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px; fill: #5C4A3D; text-anchor: middle; }
    </style>
  </defs>

  <rect class="bg" x="0" y="0" width="820" height="500" />

  <text class="head-pub" x="215" y="36">Derecho público</text>
  <text class="crit" x="215" y="58">El poder público es parte y actúa como tal</text>

  <text class="head-priv" x="605" y="36">Derecho privado</text>
  <text class="crit" x="605" y="58">Relaciones entre particulares en pie de igualdad</text>

  <line class="divider" x1="410" y1="72" x2="410" y2="392" />
  <text class="divider-label" x="410" y="416">¿quién es parte?</text>

  <!-- Public branches -->
  <rect class="col-pub" x="40" y="80" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="58" y="103">Constitucional</text>
  <text class="where" x="58" y="119">UNIDAD 3 · poderes del Estado</text>

  <rect class="col-pub" x="40" y="134" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="58" y="157">Administrativo</text>
  <text class="where" x="58" y="173">UNIDAD 8 · multas y sanciones</text>

  <rect class="col-pub" x="40" y="188" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="58" y="211">Penal</text>
  <text class="where" x="58" y="227">UNIDAD 8 · delitos</text>

  <rect class="col-pub" x="40" y="242" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="58" y="265">Tributario o fiscal</text>
  <text class="where" x="58" y="281">UNIDAD 7 · impuestos</text>

  <rect class="col-pub" x="40" y="296" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="58" y="319">Procesal</text>
  <text class="where" x="58" y="335">UNIDAD 9 · el juicio</text>

  <rect class="col-pub" x="40" y="350" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="58" y="373">Internacional público</text>
  <text class="where" x="58" y="389">UNIDAD 2 · ONU y Unión Europea</text>

  <!-- Private branches -->
  <rect class="col-priv" x="430" y="80" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="448" y="103">Civil</text>
  <text class="where" x="448" y="119">UNIDADES 4 y 5 · familia, herencia, contratos</text>

  <rect class="col-priv" x="430" y="134" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="448" y="157">Mercantil</text>
  <text class="where" x="448" y="173">EMPRESA, SOCIEDADES Y CONCURSO</text>

  <rect class="col-priv" x="430" y="188" width="350" height="46" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="448" y="211">Internacional privado</text>
  <text class="where" x="448" y="227">QUÉ LEY SE APLICA A UN CASO CON EXTRANJERÍA</text>

  <!-- Straddling branch -->
  <rect class="col-mix" x="430" y="242" width="350" height="70" rx="4" />
  <text class="branch" x="448" y="265">Laboral</text>
  <text class="where" x="448" y="281">UNIDAD 6 · el primer contrato</text>
  <text class="where" x="448" y="299">A CABALLO: CONTRATO PRIVADO, TUTELA PÚBLICA</text>

  <text class="mix-note" x="605" y="340">El Derecho laboral nace de un contrato entre particulares,</text>
  <text class="mix-note" x="605" y="358">pero el Estado interviene para proteger a la parte más débil.</text>
  <text class="mix-note" x="605" y="376">Por eso la frontera público-privado no es una pared.</text>
</svg>
